    "description": {
      "content": "The Dispatch Files API stores photos and other files associated with a job, and is served from a host distinct from the core Dispatch REST API. Files are uploaded as multipart/form-data and retrieved by UID, which redirects to the stored object.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dispatch\n Email: sales@dispatch.me",
